WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A striking response appears. The operator calls it magnetism.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
James Braid asks what attention and circumstances might explain.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The experience can be real. The proposed invisible cause is still a hypothesis.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Move the conditions. Compare what changes, and what does not.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Modern suggestion studies report specific results, not universal powers.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Separate the event, its explanation, and the promise being sold.
